---
source: crates/forage-server/src/tests/auth_pages_tests.rs
expression: "masked_main(&page.html).replace(&user_code, \"USER-CODE\")"
---
<main class="flex-1 pb-16">
<section class="max-w-md mx-auto px-4 pt-24">
<h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-center mb-2 text-gray-900">
        Authorise Seeded App
</h1>
<p class="text-center text-gray-600 mb-8">
        Approve a sign-in request from a terminal, for the
        <strong>Seeded App</strong> application.
      </p>

<div class="mb-6 p-4 bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-md text-sm text-amber-900">
<p class="font-medium">Only approve if you started this from your own terminal.</p>
<p class="mt-1">
              Approving lets <strong>Seeded App</strong> act as
              <strong>testuser</strong>, with only these permissions. It does not get your Forest session.
            </p>
<ul class="mt-2 space-y-1">
<li><span class="font-mono">datagateway:apply</span> — Define data gateway project metrics</li><li><span class="font-mono">datagateway:read</span> — Query data gateway project metrics</li>
</ul>
</div>
<form method="POST" action="/device" class="space-y-4">
<input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="test-csrf">
<input type="hidden" name="client_id" value="forest_oa_cli">
<div>
<label for="user_code" class="block text-sm font-medium mb-1 text-gray-900">
              One-time code
            </label>
<input type="text" id="user_code" name="user_code" value="USER-CODE" required autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" class="w-full px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 bg-white text-gray-900 rounded-md text-base font-mono tracking-widest text-center uppercase focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-gray-900" placeholder="XXXX-XXXX">
<p class="mt-2 text-xs text-gray-500">
              The code is shown in your terminal where you started the sign-in.
            </p>
</div>
<div class="flex gap-2">
<button type="submit" name="action" value="approve" class="flex-1 py-2 bg-gray-900 text-white rounded-md font-medium hover:bg-gray-800">
              Approve
            </button>
<button type="submit" name="action" value="deny" class="flex-1 py-2 bg-white border border-gray-300 text-gray-900 rounded-md font-medium hover:bg-gray-50">
              Deny
            </button>
</div>
</form>
</section>
</main>
